      <p>Foreign Intelligence Legislation Amendment Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 95, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to foreign intelligence, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 2 September 2021</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
